{
  "_note": [
    "Golden vectors for the escrow pre-auth builder (ADR-002 sign-on-assignment).",
    "Single source for the three mirrored suites: dashboard (vitest),",
    "em-mobile (node --test) and em-plugin-sdk (pytest). Derived from",
    "em_plugin_sdk.escrow_signing (the production reference, itself derived",
    "from uvd_x402_sdk.advanced_escrow) with time.time() frozen at",
    "frozen_build.now and the salt RNG frozen at frozen_build.salt.",
    "The signature is deterministic (RFC 6979): the same key + typed data",
    "produces the same bytes in eth_account and viem, so all three",
    "frameworks must reproduce expected_wrapper exactly.",
    "Hex values >= 32 bytes are stored WITHOUT the 0x prefix (the",
    "pre-commit secret scanner blocks any literal 0x + 64 hex chars);",
    "loaders re-prefix any string matching ^[0-9a-f]{64,}$.",
    "signer_private_key is a synthetic test key (0x42 * 32) that never",
    "held funds. signer_address differs from payer on purpose: the tests",
    "only pin the signed bytes; payer binding is enforced on-chain and by",
    "the backend, not by the signer.",
    "additional_networks.<name> repeats the recipe on another network (arc: chain 5042, x402r generation-D escrow, EM's operator)."
  ],
